{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "description": "Policy pack assign/unassign visibility from structured Information logs (EventId 3014/3015). Pair with infra/loki/archlucid-policy-pack-assignment-alerts.yml.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "## Policy pack assignments (Loki)\n\nLog lines from **`PolicyPackAssignmentRepository`** via **`SanitizedLoggerInformationExtensions`**:\n\n| EventId | Message prefix |\n|---------|----------------|\n| **3014** | `Policy pack assignment assigned: PolicyPackId=` |\n| **3015** | `Policy pack assignment unassigned: PolicyPackId=` |\n\nCorrelate with audit **`PolicyPackAssignmentCreated`** / **`PolicyPackAssignmentArchived`**. Tighten template variable **`stream_labels`** per environment (e.g. `service_name=\"archlucid-api\"`) — same guidance as **`infra/loki/archlucid-policy-pack-assignment-alerts.yml`**. Import: bind **`${datasource}`** to **Loki**.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Log source / operator notes",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Count of assign-path log lines (EventId 3014) per dashboard interval.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({${stream_labels}} |= \"Policy pack assignment assigned:\" [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "assignments",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Total assignments over time",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Top PolicyPackId values extracted from assign logs over the selected time range.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (policy_pack_id) (count_over_time({${stream_labels}} |= \"Policy pack assignment assigned:\" | regexp \"PolicyPackId=(?P<policy_pack_id>[0-9a-fA-F-]+)\" [$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{policy_pack_id}}",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Top assigned packs",
      "type": "bargauge"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Assign vs unassign rates and total mutation volume (assignment churn) per interval.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 15 },
      "id": 12,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({${stream_labels}} |= \"Policy pack assignment assigned:\" [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "assigned",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({${stream_labels}} |= \"Policy pack assignment unassigned:\" [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "unassigned",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({${stream_labels}} |~ \"Policy pack assignment (assigned|unassigned):\" [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "total churn",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Assignment churn (assign / unassign / total)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "style": "dark",
  "tags": ["archlucid", "governance", "policy-packs", "loki"],
  "templating": {
